== Contribution

I build upon the work of @heiner_charlie_2015, who presents Charlie, an educational Petri net GUI application,
which highlights the theoretical foundations of analysis results in a human-readable format.

_petrivet_ is a Rust library that provides a programmatic interface to the same theoretical foundations.

I also present in this thesis two secondary contributions:
- A catalogue of Petri net theorems and intuitive explanations of their significance.
- A discussion of the design principles that emerged during the implementation of _petrivet_.

